# W. Chan Kim

Co-author of *Blue Ocean Strategy* with Renee Mauborgne. Known for developing frameworks around market creation, value innovation, and reconstructing industry boundaries. His work emphasizes moving beyond competitive positioning into uncontested market spaces.

See also [[blue-ocean-strategy-renee-mauborgne]] and [[blue-ocean-strategy]].